%%{ init: { 'theme': 'base', 'themeVariables': { 'primaryColor': '#232F3E', 'primaryTextColor': '#fff', 'lineColor': '#FF9900' } } }%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Agent as DevOps Agent
    participant APIGW as API Gateway<br/>(SigV4 Auth)
    participant Server as MCP Server<br/>(Lambda)
    participant CB as Circuit Breaker
    participant Cache as Metadata Cache<br/>(DynamoDB)
    participant Jira as Jira Cloud<br/>(REST v3)
    participant Audit as CloudWatch<br/>Audit Log

    Note over Agent, Jira: READ PATH — e.g. get_transitions (with metadata cache)

    Agent->>+APIGW: POST /prod/mcp (SigV4 signed)<br/>{"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"get_transitions",...}}
    APIGW->>APIGW: Verify IAM SigV4 signature
    APIGW->>+Server: Invoke Lambda

    %% Circuit breaker
    Server->>CB: is_open()?
    CB-->>Server: false

    %% No idempotency check for reads
    Note over Server: Reads skip idempotency<br/>(GETs are inherently idempotent)

    %% Metadata cache lookup
    Server->>+Cache: get_or_load("transitions:KAN", loader_fn)
    Cache->>Cache: DynamoDB get_item("transitions:KAN")

    alt Cache HIT (within 1h TTL)
        Cache-->>Server: Cached transitions list
        Note right of Cache: ~10ms faster<br/>No Jira call
    else Cache MISS
        Cache->>+Jira: GET /rest/api/3/issue/KAN-1/transitions
        Jira-->>-Cache: {transitions: [...]}
        Cache->>Cache: DynamoDB put_item<br/>(TTL: 3600s)
        Cache-->>-Server: Fresh transitions list
    end

    %% Circuit breaker success
    Server->>CB: record_success()

    %% Audit
    Server->>Audit: [AUDIT] {"event":"tool_ok","tool":"get_transitions",...}

    Server-->>-APIGW: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","result":{"content":[{type:"text",...}]}}
    APIGW-->>-Agent: 200 OK
